# General rules for AI in TIA project

This is an educational project for Techniques of Artificial Intelligence (TIA) course.

- Read the project conventions first: [project-conventions.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/project-conventions.mdc)
- Use Spanish for comments and documentation when appropriate
- Follow course naming conventions for new files
- Keep original file naming from course materials

## Working with Jupyter Notebooks

- Include clear markdown headers for explanations
- Comment code thoroughly for learning purposes
- Keep cells focused and modular

## Working with PDFs

- Read and extract information from PDFs as needed
- Use PDF content to answer questions about course material